OL,3,GNEWSAMisconduct process after child
OL,4,Ahurt by police drone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police special inspector is to face
OL,7,Finternal disciplinary proceedings after
OL,8,Fa drone they were operating seriously
OL,9,Finjured a child.
OL,11,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,12,FConduct (IOPC) has concluded its
OL,13,Finvestigation into the incident, which
OL,14,Fhappened a year ago in Sheerness, Kent.
OL,16,FThe child required multiple operations
OL,17,Fafter sustaining serious injuries.
OL,19,FIt is the first time the IOPC has
OL,20,Finvestigated a drone hitting a
OL,21,Fcivilian. Kent Police confirmed a
OL,22,Fmisconduct process was now under way.
